00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.078
Sydney, so nice to meet you.

00:01:52.358 --> 00:01:53.239
Nice to meet you.

00:01:53.599 --> 00:01:54.299
Welcome.

00:01:54.299 --> 00:01:54.960
Thank you.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:55.640
