00:04:55.277 --> 00:04:56.618
Dr Riddell, Sydney.

00:04:58.079 --> 00:04:59.760
This would be to test my intolerances.

00:05:00.256 --> 00:05:02.277
In order to temporarily change my diet.

00:05:04.378 --> 00:05:07.520
Whoa So this is really not so good.

