So?

00:05:52.509 --> 00:05:53.209
More.

00:05:53.209 --> 00:05:54.190
There is something behind.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:55.490
You're right.

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:56.251
It's in behind.

00:05:56.252 --> 00:05:56.952
It's in behind.

