00:07:31.773 --> 00:07:35.734
Small dessert.

00:07:35.774 --> 00:07:37.355
Oh, thank you so much.

00:07:37.356 --> 00:07:38.056
So enjoy.

00:07:38.355 --> 00:07:39.055
Thank you.

00:07:39.355 --> 00:07:41.236
And then we can have a rest after that.

00:07:41.237 --> 00:07:41.937
Thank you.

00:07:41.937 --> 00:07:43.836
Bioresonance, electrodermal testing.

00:07:44.397 --> 00:07:47.037
