00:11:24.864 --> 00:11:25.644
Cravings.

00:11:25.664 --> 00:11:28.265
Some people do experience less of an
appetite.

00:11:28.706 --> 00:11:31.227
But what about cravings for alcohol?

00:11:31.228 --> 00:11:32.227
Cravings for alcohol?

00:11:32.327 --> 00:11:33.267
I have not heard that.

00:11:33.307 --> 00:11:36.129
No.

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:39.330
I'm beginning to feel sceptical about how
any of these treatments and lifestyle

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:42.551
