treatments.

00:11:47.893 --> 00:11:49.194
Then I would do acupuncture.

00:11:49.594 --> 00:11:51.215
I'm just like shooting in my back.

00:11:52.195 --> 00:11:54.136
I didn't know if I was being a massive
cynic.

00:11:54.316 --> 00:11:56.318
or whether all of this was actually a bit
daft.

00:11:56.358 --> 00:11:58.159
You pop your eyes in.

00:11:58.900 --> 00:11:59.600
Yes.

00:11:59.921 --> 00:12:00.621
Oh.

00:12:00.621 --> 00:12:01.542
Oh, yes.

