00:12:19.517 --> 00:12:20.458
Kidney, I'm fine.

00:12:20.979 --> 00:12:21.879
Your liver is fine.

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:22.680
Great.

00:12:23.476 --> 00:12:27.479
In order to show me just how effective
